{"unit_id":"ztting01__dsh-agentenv-sandbox#card-zh","repo":"ztting01/dsh-agentenv-sandbox","commit":"565f1befa69f66e13798c331b4699cd2d8f3abb5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agentenv-sandbox 是一个供 DeepSeek Harness 使用的 AgentENV 沙箱插件。它通过 bundle 替换本地文件与进程提供者，将 DSH 的文件、Bash、终端及相关进程操作接入同一个 AgentENV 微虚拟机。插件会在启动时将工作区上传至沙箱，并支持租约续期及关闭时销毁或暂停沙箱；文件上传有数量和字节上限，也可配置内部符号链接策略。适合希望把 Harness 工作区操作放到远程 Linux 沙箱中的用户。需要已部署的 AgentENV、API 凭据和现成模板。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:39-65","src/index.ts:118-130","src/workspace.ts:139-166"]}
{"unit_id":"ztting01__dsh-agentenv-sandbox#card-en","repo":"ztting01/dsh-agentenv-sandbox","commit":"565f1befa69f66e13798c331b4699cd2d8f3abb5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agentenv-sandbox connects DSH file and process providers to one AgentENV microVM. It uploads the workspace, renews the lease, and can kill or pause the sandbox. Upload bounds and symlink handling are configurable. Requires AgentENV, credentials, and an existing template.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:39-65","src/index.ts:118-130","src/workspace.ts:139-166"]}
