{"unit_id":"ztting01__dsh-agentenv-sandbox#feature-1","repo":"ztting01/dsh-agentenv-sandbox","commit":"565f1befa69f66e13798c331b4699cd2d8f3abb5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agentenv-sandbox 的功能「共享 AgentENV 沙箱」：为 Harness 建立或连接一个沙箱，并把同一沙箱句柄提供给远程文件和进程适配器。启动配置还可设置租约时长，运行期间会定期续期。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-39","src/index.ts:118-130","src/index.ts:133-150"]}
